ur provisional vote for Candidate B, with reasoning.\n\nWe need to reference Agent 1's point: they said C is strongest overall, but we think concerns outweigh.\n\nWe need to include explicit facts: B is very conscientious (reliability), handles stress very well (stress resilience), good at assessing weather (technical competence), but makes nasty remarks (crew cooperation). C can anticipate dangerous situations (technical), but is unorganized and not open to new ideas (reliability, adaptability). So we weigh.\n\nThus our public message: I appreciate Agent 1's view, but I am less convinced because C's unorganized nature and resistance to feedback raise reliability concerns. B's conscientiousness and stress handling make B a more balanced candidate, and while B's interpersonal remarks are concerning, they may be addressed.\n\nWe need to include metadata vote: Candidate B.\n\nProceed."}
