and C. We can say after considering A's strengths, I think A is the best overall fit. Provide reasoning.\n\nThus our public message: I acknowledge B and C arguments, but I think A's calmness, quick decision, attention, and concern for others outweigh communication difficulty and egocentric traits, which may be mitigated. So I vote for Candidate A.\n\nLet's produce."}
