itical for long-distance flights. So we can reaffirm C.\n\nThus public message: I acknowledge Agent 3's points, but I still think C is best because technical competence, anticipation, leadership outweigh organization and feedback concerns, which can be mitigated. Also A's communication issues are more severe for crew cooperation. B's interpersonal hostility also problematic. D lacks data and has arrogance. So I keep vote for C.\n\nProceed."}
